> Get the patch utility from http://gnuwin32.sourceforge.net/. After
> installing it, copy patch.exe to the bottom of the Nethack source tree
> as lpatch.exe (as I've found that there is already a patch.exe in
> Windows XP, and so it uses the wrong one at the command line) along
> with the .diff patch file. Open a command prompt and apply the patch
> by issuing the command "lpatch -p0 --binary < patchname.diff", and
> then build as before.

